[statement]
A dependency on a real package name is followed at once, before any name
provided by another package is decided: `pb`, the single provider of `B`,
depends on the real `kw`, and `kw` is installed before `v`, reached
first, is decided, so `v` needs nothing more.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:A B

P:pa
V:1
p:A=1
D:v

P:pb
V:1
p:B=1
D:kw

P:kw
V:1
p:v w=1

P:gk
V:1
p:v
k:100

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install kw 1
install pa 1
install pb 1
install app 1
